WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing heavy punch begins the corner route.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.350
OD Adamant Flame launches Ryu beside the wall.

3
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.150
Crouching heavy punch catches Ryu after the Flame follow-up.

4
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.000
OD Tatsu hits Ryu repeatedly in the corner.

5
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.750
Heavy Tatsu follows the OD Tatsu juggle.

6
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.450
Ryu recovers beside the corner after the Tatsu ender.
